msgid ""
"VIS-IR - 'Traditional' RGB combination, approaching human eye perception.\n"
"\n"
"  - YELLOWISH = low to medium cloudiness (generally warmer)\n"
"  - WHITE to BLUE = high cloudiness (cold)\n"
"  - GREEN = vegetation-covered terrain\n"
"  - DARK BLUE = water"
